      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hearing that the resources don't immediately feel helpful is painful, but believing a broken self can simply \"let go\" and end suffering is a dangerous way to cope that ignores the possibility of healing. It is important to gently hope that despair is a symptom of a broken situation that can be fixed by professional help rather than a permanent reality. Please try to reach out for support from a trusted doctor or crisis line one more time to consider a path that allows you to feel peace without ending your life.",
